	<title>
		Calibration of a Hyperviscoelastic Material Model for Silicone Structural Glazing Joints in the Context of Earthquakes  
							| Challenging Glass Conference Proceedings
			</title>

	
<link rel="icon" href="https://proceedings.challengingglass.com/public/journals/1/favicon_en_US.png" />
<meta name="csrf-token" content="UZi7CjSsmKNscIJU5PxOSr140V91uFbMX0YoqXWs" />
